`src/cryptopos_rail_ootle/chain.py` is this project's own code, extracted from
`cryptopos-core` when the drivable rails moved into their own packages. It
carries no third-party copyright and is covered by the notice above -- which is
the reason this file exists at all: until 2026-08-31 the rail distributions
shipped `License: MIT` in their metadata and no licence text, so a recipient of
that extracted code was given no copyright notice, no permission grant and no
warranty disclaimer with it.
